# Where is it? где, в and на in Russian
subtitle: "Ask where something is in Russian with где, answer with тут, там, в and на, and see why the place word ends in е."
teaches: ["phrases/where-is-it","grammar/place-ending"]
thumb: "band \"Where's the cat?\" note \"где = where\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A longer Russian story: read it all yourself","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/10-russian-review.cast"}

## Where is it? где, в and на in Russian
level: basic

    path ground thick #8f887c points [[30,210],[600,210]] hidden true
    shape walls thick #3d3833 shape rect x 300 y 352 width 440 height 284 style.fill #f6efe2 hidden true
    path roof closed thick #3d3833 points [[55,494],[300,600],[545,494]] style.fill #d9a58b hidden true
    shape win thick #3d3833 shape rect x 170 y 420 width 120 height 100 style.fill #dcecf5 hidden true
    path win_v #3d3833 points [[170,370],[170,470]] style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    path win_h #3d3833 points [[110,420],[230,420]] style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    path sill #3d3833 points [[92,368],[248,368]] style.stroke_width 6 hidden true
    group g_win members ["win","win_v","win_h","sill"] hidden true
    shape tbl_top #7a5236 shape rect x 400 y 300 width 190 height 14 style.fill #a87650 style.stroke_width 2 hidden true
    path leg1 #7a5236 points [[320,293],[320,212]] style.stroke_width 5 hidden true
    path leg2 #7a5236 points [[480,293],[480,212]] style.stroke_width 5 hidden true
    group g_tbl members ["tbl_top","leg1","leg2"] hidden true
    group g_house members ["walls","roof"] hidden true
    path sea closed thick #5b8fb0 points [[600,240],[650,252],[700,240],[750,252],[800,240],[850,252],[900,240],[950,252],[985,242],[985,165],[600,165]] style.fill #a9cfe3 hidden true
    icon tom size 120 set twemoji x 175 y 278 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 175 y 192 font_size 26 hidden true
    icon cat size 80 set twemoji x 700 y 292 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon beach size 80 set twemoji x 925 y 285 or ["umbrella on ground","palm tree"] icon_look picture of "beach with umbrella" hidden true
    icon book size 56 set twemoji x 400 y 335 or ["green book","books"] icon_look picture of "closed book" hidden true
    icon cat_sill size 80 set twemoji x 170 y 408 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon cat_sea size 80 set twemoji x 700 y 292 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon cat_tbl size 80 set twemoji x 400 y 347 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon cat_book size 80 set twemoji x 400 y 403 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    text lab_tam "там" #8f887c say там x 700 y 352 font_size 32 hidden true
    text lab_tut "тут" #8f887c say тут x 262 y 312 font_size 32 hidden true
    text o2_1 "Кот в до́ме." say true x 790 y 540 font_size 42 hidden true
    text o2_2 "Кот на мо́ре." say true x 790 y 470 font_size 42 hidden true
    text o2_3 "Кот на столе́." say true x 790 y 400 font_size 42 hidden true
    text o5_1 "Кот на кни́га." x 790 y 540 font_size 42 hidden true
    text o5_2 "Кот на кни́ге." say true x 790 y 470 font_size 42 hidden true
    text o5_3 "Кот в кни́ге." x 790 y 400 font_size 42 hidden true
    text r_kniga "кни́га → на кни́ге" say "на кни́ге" colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 360 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed q "Где кот?" say_voice b gloss ["where","cat"] show_gloss under x 790 y 590 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed a_tam "Кот там." say_voice a gloss ["cat","there"] show_gloss under x 790 y 470 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed a_tut "Кот тут." say_voice a gloss ["cat","here"] show_gloss under x 790 y 470 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed a_dom "Кот в до́ме." say_voice a gloss ["cat","in","house"] show_gloss under colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 470 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed a_stol "Кот на столе́." say_voice a gloss ["cat","on","table"] show_gloss under colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 470 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed a_okno "Кот на окне́." say_voice a gloss ["cat","on","window"] show_gloss under colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 470 font_size 50 hidden true
    text r_dom "дом → в до́ме" say "в до́ме" colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 620 font_size 42 hidden true
    text r_stol "стол → на столе́" say "на столе́" colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 555 font_size 42 hidden true
    text r_okno "окно́ → на окне́" say "на окне́" colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 490 font_size 42 hidden true
    text r_more "мо́ре → на мо́ре" say "на мо́ре" colors {"е$":"#d0865f"} x 790 y 425 font_size 42 hidden true
    group rule members ["r_dom","r_stol","r_okno"] hidden true

    card title "Where is it?"

A: How do you say where something is in Russian? We'll follow this cat around a house and find out.
    draw g_house ground g_win g_tbl sea beach tom tom_name cat parallel true

B: I'll ask the question: где кот? Где means where, so: where's the cat?
    draw q

    draw a_tam lab_tam parallel true

A: He's far off by the sea, so I answer кот там: the cat is there, with там from lesson one.
    blocking false

    highlight cat effect circle color #2f6b8f duration 3

    highlight a_tam_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c duration 3

    hide a_tam a_tam_g_1 a_tam_g_2

A: Now he runs in to me, and the answer changes: кот тут, the cat is here.
    move cat duration 1.6 to [262,250]

    draw a_tut lab_tut parallel true

B: Тут is here, near the speaker; там is over there. And, as always, Russian needs no word for is.
    blocking false

    highlight a_tut_w_2 lab_tut effect underline color #8f887c duration 2.4

    highlight lab_tam effect underline color #8f887c duration 2

    pause 1.6

    hide a_tut a_tut_g_1 a_tut_g_2 lab_tut lab_tam

    draw a_dom

A: To say where exactly, put в, in, before the place: кот в до́ме, the cat is in the house.
    blocking false

    highlight a_dom_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c duration 2.8

    highlight walls effect glow color #8f887c duration 3

B: And дом has gained an е, just as ресторан did in the story: в рестора́не.
    highlight a_dom_w_3 effect pulse color #d0865f part е$

    hide a_dom a_dom_g_1 a_dom_g_2 a_dom_g_3

B: Где кот? Up on the table: кот на столе́.
    blocking false

    move cat duration 1 to.ref tbl_top to.anchor top anchor bottom

    highlight g_tbl effect glow color #8f887c duration 2.4

    draw a_stol

A: На means on, and стол gains the same е: на столе́.
    blocking false

    highlight a_stol_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c duration 1.6

    highlight a_stol_w_3 effect pulse color #d0865f part е$ duration 2.4

    hide a_stol a_stol_g_1 a_stol_g_2 a_stol_g_3

B: And now? Кот на окне́: on the window, on the sill.
    blocking false

    move cat duration 1.2 to.ref sill to.anchor mid anchor bottom

    highlight g_win effect glow color #8f887c duration 2.4

    draw a_okno

A: Окно́ ends in о, so the о makes way for е: окно́, на окне́.
    highlight a_okno_w_3 effect pulse color #d0865f part е$

    erase a_okno a_okno_g_1 a_okno_g_2 a_okno_g_3 q q_g_1 q_g_2

A: So here's the pattern: after в or на, most words end in е.
    draw r_dom r_stol r_okno

B: Где кот? Back where he started: кот на мо́ре, at the seaside.
    blocking false

    move cat duration 1.6 to [700,292]

    highlight sea effect glow color #8f887c duration 2.6

    draw r_more

A: Мо́ре already ends in е, so it doesn't change at all.
    highlight r_more effect pulse color #d0865f part е$

B: Why на? Russians say на мо́ре for a seaside holiday; в мо́ре would mean in the water.
    highlight sea effect glow color #8f887c

    hide tom tom_name beach cat r_dom r_stol r_okno r_more

    ask "Кот на окне́. Tap the place where the cat is." choose ["g_win","g_tbl","sea"] answer g_win reveal "на окне́" reveal_at.x 170 reveal_at.y 560 reveal_draw ["cat_sill"] test t1
        intro: Five questions now; the cat is hiding.
        right: The window: на окне́, from окно́.
        wrong: Which word hides in окне́: стол, окно́ or мо́ре?

    erase reveal_1_stamp choose_1_ring cat_sill

    draw o2_1 o2_2 o2_3 parallel true

    ask "The cat is at the seaside. Tap the sentence that says so." choose ["o2_1","o2_2","o2_3"] answer o2_2 reveal_draw ["beach","cat_sea"] test t1
        right: Кот на мо́ре: на, and мо́ре stays as it is.
        wrong: Which of these places is wet?

    erase o2_1 o2_2 o2_3 cat_sea beach

    ask "The cat is on the table. Finish it: Кот на …" answer ["столе"] translit true reveal "на столе́" reveal_at.x 650 reveal_at.y 400 test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧЫЬЯ
        right: Столе́: стол, plus the е that comes after на.
        wrong: After на, стол ends in …?

    show cat_tbl

    pause 1.2

    erase reveal_2_stamp cat_tbl

    ask "Type the Russian word for where." answer ["где"] translit true reveal Где? reveal_at.x 790 reveal_at.y 470 test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧЫЬЯ
        right: Где: где кот? Where's the cat?
        wrong: Masha asked it at the start: three letters, starting with Г.

    erase reveal_3_stamp

    draw o5_1 o5_2 o5_3 parallel true

    ask "One more place: the cat lies on a book, кни́га. Tap the right sentence." choose ["o5_1","o5_2","o5_3"] answer o5_2 reveal_draw ["book","cat_book"] test t1
        right: Кот на кни́ге: on, so на, and the а of кни́га makes way for е, as окно́'s о did.
        wrong: He's on it, not in it; and what does the last letter become after на?

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase o5_1 o5_2 o5_3

    show r_dom r_stol r_okno r_more beach

    draw r_kniga

A: So that's where anything is in Russian: где asks, в or на answers, and the place after them ends in е.
    blocking false

    highlight r_dom r_stol r_okno r_more r_kniga effect underline color #8f887c duration 3.4

    highlight r_dom r_stol r_okno r_more r_kniga effect pulse color #d0865f part е$ duration 2.6

    hide cat_book

    show tom tom_name cat

A: А я? Я тут, в до́ме. Пока́!
    move cat duration 1.2 to [262,250]

